=====Usage notes=====
* See {{m|en|whilst}}.
* In media and discussions of public policy, usage like ''he was pulled over for driving '''while''' intoxicated'' has been (somewhat jocularly) extended to refer to cases of [[racial profiling|racial]] or religious [[profiling]], when someone is ''pulled over for driving '''while''' black'', or ''travelling '''while''' Muslim'', etc.<!--moved to usage notes per TR, had been its own sense-->

